{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_026_01_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:80921d109ec3c58de1aa65aa6f18f9043bc53f700e0fcaddbbc6a0fe9dac491d",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_b:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d6e1d454ee707f6fd0abb2049a8be75802d0eb819090aca33e36496aa6982ff",
      "text": "花音、咲大哥、道夫大哥、\n诚司大哥。还有我。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_b:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:066996bacda7291b47675d65f9e92d1fc45e2fc0b7845afaded3977fa056191c",
      "text": "番长一个人就能统筹好这些个性强烈的偶像，\n我想仰仗一下你的手腕。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_b:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4be89dafddbb29520e8a0d6bdcfeb2a8f132a07668f63e8659f1526d060f9f68",
      "text": "不过番长也很忙吧。\n我绝不勉强。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_b:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33deb5c81b80e68e9db855162dff275d6584e50174fd321c52810cf570a95d11",
      "text": "请务必让我帮这个忙！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_b:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a8329ac7b0e37f3d32aacf6083fe588451e286699e4b5f8fe1cabc7351f098f",
      "text": "呵，谢了，番长。\n那事不宜迟，下一个休息日怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_b:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4cc091cb04776568812b3d86cde2fb2d8f8606c66e0d81f2748441aefc9eff8",
      "text": "有一家我经常光顾的大玩具店。\n就去那里吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_b:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:69bd8292dafea7ec97c1a5813d171cccb4672c948e3b8b921bec5a7979c982b4",
      "text": "明白了。\n为了能帮上玄武先生的忙，我会努力的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_b:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5447fb68fd67c87c8cf42fd0d3b7e010b62fdb76bf1d01cc591c45fa8698b533",
      "text": "哈哈，那就拜托你了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_b:cmd-000056:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_b:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:06a42a98498d2741649fe711261c6d9ab9a755311a0620449ceb44872cc283c7",
      "text": "番长，这边。很准时嘛。\n难得的休息日还要你陪我跑一趟，抱歉啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_b:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29400cc41312001ac9091a674a69651d69a3483c7ce8a5f84ca179ec82584929",
      "text": "不会，我也好久没来这么大的玩具店了，\n心里其实兴奋得很呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_b:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43dc6bd301500b26dca223995227496bc2080221047cc7d87909810b0657b5f1",
      "text": "那敢情好。\n既然这样，我们这就进去吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
